Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: visionox-vtdr6130-cog: add Pocket Duo top panel

Add vtdr6130,rpduo alongside the existing handheld variants and share their
initialization sequence. Select vendor packet type and startup delays from
the descriptor; send the additional page-select/D0 writes only for Duo.
Preserve the existing initializer name, command formatting and refresh branches.

Reuse the RP6's 1080x1920 120/60 Hz timings, as in RetroidPocket's Duo
driver. Add ordered supply configuration and a DBV 2047 default. Existing
Pocket 6, RP5 and Flip 2 packet streams, delays, timing tables, supply
lists and brightness behavior are unchanged.

Source: Retroid_Pocket_Duo.zip, selected VTDR6130 command-mode panel
SHA256: 84e4f59c05114511ad13c87ff3815ebe57aab1ad9ec1fc9606854ee763e11451
Mode reference: RetroidPocket/linux, panel-visionox-vtdr6130.c.
Status: 60 Hz initialization tested on the unit; 120 Hz awaits validation.

